(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-67","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["站长说基金肯[[donate|捐赠]]，我们却只学会[[defiance|违抗]]。有人替避险点[[cater|提供饮食]]，纸旗在风里[[flutter|飘动]]，两种情绪也在门口[[overlap|重叠]]。馆员抱着一本讲[[materialism|唯物主义]]的旧校书，原本要查候鸟[[migrate|迁徙]]的日期。柜旁[[easter|复活节]]捐赠照露出与今日相同的封签。经理要[[abolish|废止]]旧编号，程雾却将照片[[magnify|放大]]，让两端缺口一起入镜。他说副本全是[[redundant|多余的]]，我问为什么要拿不一样的日子写同一张接收表。钥匙终于放到桌上，谁也没有伸手先抢。","原柜[[situated|位于]]朝海墙边，站长说[[doubtless|无疑]]其记录已经失效。表上只有[[analogous|类似的]]用途名，实际日期不相同。他的[[complexion|面色]]因被追问变红，报损的[[continuity|连续性]]却不容一句话抹掉。一个岛民将门旁[[sculpture|雕塑]]移开，给检查员让路。这项[[timely|及时的]]帮助出自住在[[cape|海角]]的渔夫，他正领生活[[subsidy|补助]]，仍不愿被骂成[[obscene|可憎的]]忘恩者。所谓[[thanksgiving|感恩]]墙上贴着他的脸，他要求先撤照片，再谈那笔补助，不愿家人的饭碗成为自己永远同意的证明。","监管员有维修[[proficiency|熟练技能]]，在岛上[[vocational|职业的]]学校教过工人。站长想[[designate|指派]]她只查新柜，她认为那不是[[promising|有希望的]]办法，更不是[[practicable|可行的]]取证；作为[[superintendent|主管人]]，她要先确认所有锁的去向。柜从未开过的[[probability|可能性]]已很低，站长仍站在[[lofty|高高的]]台阶发出[[denial|否认]]。柜边木片显示一次[[assault|撞击]]，装卸员说那是推车碰的，不是有人砸柜。监管员让他说完，免得破损又被写成全由某一个手粗的工人造成。","补助协议的[[implicit|含蓄的]]要求，随停航[[intensify|加剧]]。站长称感恩书的[[feminine|女性化的]]字体温柔，可以证明援助的[[purity|纯洁]]，想[[heighten|增强]]气氛。网上的[[web|网络]]照片把监管员的[[femininity|女性气质]]说成她的贡献，却不写她干过的维修。她把照片倒扣，说水位到了[[plateau|稳定时期]]也不等于没风险，岛民对补助的[[reliance|依赖]]更不能代替签字。她先做[[tentative|试探性的]]安全检查，再[[preside|主持]]开柜过程。每次动作都有镜头记录，馆员站在边上核目录，纸不是从谁的袖口里突然变出来的。","广播员用[[transistor|晶体管收音机]]听大陆播报，柜里的[[statistics|统计表]]却显示动物[[offspring|后代]]与援助箱数被相加。这样的合并或许能[[alleviate|减轻]]报表压力，也能[[enrich|丰富]]宣传，却不能回答旧物去向。一张领用联注明柜曾进低处[[cellar|地窖]]，那次潮水让玻璃[[shatter|碎裂]]。老陈指出这不是新伤口，表签保存袋也有相应旧湿线。监管员将原表按页提出，第一层却只是正式上报的誊写件。值守员提醒还有夹层，里面是从未对外送出的实际进出页，封套压着他去年的字。","执勤员登记封套，我们暂时没有翻。海角渔夫把家人的照片带走，饭仍按避险名单供应，没有谁因拒签就被请出门。程雾低头看包扎的指头，说手痛时才知道签一个字也有分量。站长让她别把简单慈善想复杂，她没有回应，只问封套从何时归他控制。监管员给出借柜日期，与旧维修工的回执连起来。今天我们拿到的是原实际页的封套，不是所有答案。拆阅要在明早稳定的台面与照明下进行，今晚守住它，以及那些终于没有在感恩墙下低头的人。"],"en":["The director said the fund would [[donate|donate]] while we offered [[defiance|defiance]]. Volunteers came to [[cater|cater]] for evacuees; flags would [[flutter|flutter]] as feelings [[overlap|overlap]]. The curator carried an old [[materialism|materialism]] textbook to check dates when birds [[migrate|migrate]]. An [[easter|Easter]] donation photograph showed today's seal. Told to [[abolish|abolish]] numbers, Cheng chose to [[magnify|magnify]] matching gaps. The manager called copies [[redundant|redundant]]. Why did different days share one receipt? He finally placed the key down without anyone grabbing it.","The cabinet was [[situated|situated]] seaward. Its records were [[doubtless|doubtless]] obsolete, he claimed. [[analogous|Analogous]] purpose names concealed differing dates. His [[complexion|complexion]] reddened; damage-report [[continuity|continuity]] remained. An islander moved a [[sculpture|sculpture]] aside in [[timely|timely]] help. This [[cape|cape]] fisherman received a [[subsidy|subsidy]] yet refused the [[obscene|obscene]] label of ingratitude. His face hung on the [[thanksgiving|thanksgiving]] wall. He requested its removal before discussing support, unwilling to make his family's meals proof of perpetual agreement.","A supervisor with repair [[proficiency|proficiency]] had taught at the [[vocational|vocational]] school. Attempts to [[designate|designate]] only new-cabinet checks were neither [[promising|promising]] nor [[practicable|practicable]]. As [[superintendent|superintendent]] she traced every lock. An unopened cabinet's [[probability|probability]] seemed low, but the director issued [[denial|denial]] from [[lofty|lofty]] steps. Wood showed an [[assault|assault]] by impact. A loader identified a cart collision, not deliberate smashing. She allowed him to finish, preventing damage from becoming another single-worker accusation.","The [[implicit|implicit]] conditions of subsidies would [[intensify|intensify]] during isolation. The director praised [[feminine|feminine]] gratitude-script as aid [[purity|purity]] and tried to [[heighten|heighten]] sentiment. The [[web|web]] celebrated the supervisor's [[femininity|femininity]] rather than repairs. Turning photographs down, she said a water-level [[plateau|plateau]] was not safety, nor financial [[reliance|reliance]] a signature. After [[tentative|tentative]] safety checks she would [[preside|preside]] over opening. Cameras recorded actions; the curator checked lists. No paper appeared conveniently from somebody's sleeve.","A [[transistor|transistor]] carried mainland broadcasts. Cabinet [[statistics|statistics]] added animal [[offspring|offspring]] to aid boxes. Combining totals might [[alleviate|alleviate]] reporting pressure and [[enrich|enrich]] publicity, not explain cargo. A receipt named a [[cellar|cellar]] where flooding made glass [[shatter|shatter]]. Chen identified old damage and matching damp lines. The supervisor retrieved reported transcripts first. A keeper indicated an inner envelope containing actual movements never sent outward, beneath his original handwritten seal. Officers registered it before examination.","The fisherman retrieved family photographs; refusing gratitude signatures cost nobody meals. Looking at her dressed finger, Cheng said even signing could carry weight. The director urged simplicity. She asked when the envelope came under his control. The supervisor's date connected to the worker's receipt. We held actual-record pages, not every answer. Examination would wait for stable lighting tomorrow. Tonight we would protect the envelope and people finally able to stand without bowing beneath a gratitude wall."]});
